# Mikey & Don, Party Planners: "If you cast a creature spell this way, that creature enters with an additional +1/+1 counter on it."
# A rule of how the spell was cast, made as it is cast (CR 601.2a, 614.1c), so it still applies when Mikey & Don has left before
# the spell resolves (the owner's ruling for Kess, Lier and Leonardo, Sewer Samurai). Bot1 casts Foot Elite (a Ninja) from the top of
# its library, then Unsummons Mikey & Don in response: Foot Elite still enters a 3/5 with the counter.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mikey & Don, Party Planners
Unsummon
Island
Foot Elite
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Mikey & Don, Party Planners.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Library.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Library.Foot Elite.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Close mana window)
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Unsummon.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Mikey & Don, Party Planners)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Hand = Mikey & Don, Party Planners
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand = Mikey & Don, Party Planners
Bot1.Battlefield.Foot Elite.Power = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Foot Elite.Toughness = 5
Bot1.Battlefield.Foot Elite.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 1
